{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28314","headline":"李侍郎於阳羡里富有泉石牧亦於阳羡粗有薄产叙旧述怀因献长句四韵 · 杜牧","name":"李侍郎於阳羡里富有泉石牧亦於阳羡粗有薄产叙旧述怀因献长句四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冥鸿不下非无意，塞马归来是偶然。\n紫绶公卿今放旷，白头郎吏尚留连。\n终南山下抛泉洞，阳羡溪中买钓船。\n欲与明公操履杖，愿闻休去是何年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28314.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28314","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}